Z||000008||Ken Wittlief||05-17-2001||10:07 AM||||BTW I got two packs each of 320 and 600 wetsandpaper last night and Im taking the peeling clear coat off the rest of the car and going after the wheels too.<P>  took the last step needed last night, borrowed my daughters digital camera and took a full set of 'before' pictures of the car. Now Im ready to tear into it.<P>  Weekend ahead - project car inthe driveway in springtime. Does it get any better than this?||||reg||1
